  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 2704.03 Termination",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2704.03 Termination. Permittees shall return their hospital emergency permit to the department upon retirement, termination of employment, or change in employment such that the permittee is no longer classified as hospital emergency personnel.\n\nSource. #4976, eff 11-14-90; ss and moved by #6174, eff\n\n1-26-96 (from Saf-C 2702), EXPIRED: 1-26-04\n\nNew. #8073, eff 4-23-04; ss by #10084, eff 1-31-12; ss by #13214-A, eff 6-16-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c2700.html"
